Description: testsuite: the luminance API, and a plain 16 bit area on X11
 /glarea/volume: luminances, mastering display and content light levels are
 unset by default, set, read back and unset again; surface-shown and
 surface-error are false and NULL on a new area. /glarea/plain-deep-x11: a
 plain area deeper than 8 bits on an X11 display says why its picture cannot
 reach the compositor on a surface of its own and renders it into its window
 (Debian's build runs the suite under Xvfb).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (queue row 137, GIMP milestone 3)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
